  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>Stablecoin market cap fell 2.2% over 30D:</strong> Stablecoin market cap at $288.04B (2.2% lower over 30D) points to contracting crypto dollar liquidity\u2014often a tighter tape for market-making, DeFi collateral, and risk appetite. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/10/29/from-rivals-to-partners-polygon-and-solana-team-to-bring-stablecoin-payments-to-banks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">From rivals to partners: Polygon and Solana team to bring stablecoin payments to banks</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Stablecoin market structure remains concentration-led:</strong> leadership is still defined by a small set of large issuers/platforms; share shifts matter as much as aggregate market-cap growth. Related: <a href=\"https://decrypt.co/382030/moodys-rates-ripples-2-6b-rlusd-stablecoin-a2-a-day-after-occ-bank-approval\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Moody&#x27;s Rates Ripple&#x27;s $2.6B RLUSD Stablecoin A2, a Day After OCC Bank Approval</a> (Decrypt).</li><li><strong>Bank rails are pushing stablecoins into treasury workflows:</strong> That pushes demand toward treasury and settlement use cases, not only exchange trading liquidity. Related: <a href=\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/bank-of-england-opens-consultation-on-tokenized-collateral-for-clearing?utm_source=rss_feed&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Bank of England opens consultation on tokenized collateral for clearing</a> (CoinTelegraph).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
